<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective March 27-April 2:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 61.56</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 65.56</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 67.41</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 70.79</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$171.08</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$128.21</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 90.13</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 23.07</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.31</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 25.54</p>
</text>
